{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Blow</b> — This prophet said: gird yourselves before this day comes. And when the day comes he said: blow the shofar. And on account of this he also said \"even now,\" that when the day of YHWH comes they shall return to HaShem, for He will do wonders for you."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:26.039440739Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}